+/*
+ * j0159: one power reading over a window, as the power plan's end measurement: `cpuidle meter
+ * SECS [WAIT]` waits WAIT s (default 60: unplug, screen off), then averages the gauge current
+ * once a second for SECS s (default 600), with the AP's XO-off time over the same window and
+ * whether the screen stayed off and USB unplugged throughout. `cpuidle meter`: the result.
